      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING DOORMAT (5) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Warragul over 400m behind Chalk And Cheese (23.63) in a Free For All. Can bounce back. TOP KADE (3) was a winner (20.15) at this track two back but out of the placings last time when 8th there. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Key player if finds best. HAPPY LIFE (6) has shown good speed at her last couple and filled minor placings, last time finishing second beaten 1.5 lengths (20.03). Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Overdue and is among the main hopes. SUBLIME (1) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to bounce back.",
